# Project Conventions

- Monorepo packages: `client/` (React SPA), `server/` (Express API), `shared/` (`@ems/shared` contract).
- API types/enums live in `shared/` — do not duplicate DTO shapes in client or server.
- No `console.log` in production paths. Client: guard with `import.meta.env.DEV` or omit. Server: use `libs/logger` (pino).
- Never hardcode secrets. AI must not run `npm install <pkg>` without user approval.
- Do not introduce Next.js, Redux, Zustand, Tailwind, Prisma, NestJS, GraphQL, or MongoDB — stack is fixed (see `docs/TECHNICAL_DOCUMENTATION.md`).
- Prefer small, focused changes. Match existing folder layout and naming.
